            <ArticleTitle>Genomic Characterization of the First Equine-Like G3P[8] Rotavirus Strain Detected in the United States.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01341-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01341-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the full coding region sequences for all 11 segments of the first equine-like G3P[8] rotavirus strain detected in the United States, strain RVA/Human-wt/USA/3000390639/2015/G3P[8]. The full genotype constellation of this strain is G3-P[8]-I2-R2-C2-M2-A2-N2-T2-E2-H2.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
